Tomorrow — how to open it again

Open Anaconda Prompt and type:

conda activate ipc_chatbot

Then:

cd C:\Users\stgrj\Documents\IPC_Chatbot

Then:

streamlit run app.py

It will start your IPC Legal Assistant chatbot again. 🎉

The browser may automatically open. If it doesn't, Anaconda Prompt will show a local address such as:

http://localhost:8501

Open that in Chrome.

Important: You don't need to recreate the environment, install packages, or create the dataset again tomorrow. Everything you've already set up remains on your computer.

Go sleep peacefully 😄🌙 — your project is saved.